 "messages": [
  {
   "id": 0,
   "en": "{07 1d 00}Eh?{01 00 00 14 00} {0b 03 00}{04 1f 00}, you haven't\ncaught it yet, have you?!?\n\n{0b 03 00}{0b 01 00}{04 1a 00}\nis mine,{01 00 00 0a 00} {04 02 00}!",
   "et": "{07 1d 00}Ah?{01 00 00 14 00} {0b 03 00}{04 1f 00}, sa pole\nseda veel püüdnud, ega?!?\n\n{0b 03 00}{0b 01 00}{04 1a 00}\non minu oma,{01 00 00 0a 00} {04 02 00}!"
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "en": "{07 16 00}But we usually get along so\nwell{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}\n\n{07 08 00}Why won't you come out,\n{0b 02 00}{04 1a 00}?\nC'mon, be a pal!",
   "et": "{07 16 00}Aga me saame tavaliselt\nnii hästi läbi{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}\n\n{07 08 00}Miks sa välja ei tule,\n{0b 02 00}{04 1a 00}?\nOle nüüd, ole sõber!"
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "en": "{07 1c 00}{01 00 00 05 00}Sigh...{01 00 00 0a 00} He's gone.\nMy {0b 02 00}{04 1a 00}\nis gone,{01 00 00 0a 00} {04 02 00}.",
   "et": "{07 1c 00}{01 00 00 05 00}Ohkan...{01 00 00 0a 00} Ta on läinud.\nMu {0b 02 00}{04 1a 00}\non läinud,{01 00 00 0a 00} {04 02 00}."
  }
 ]
